{"pos": "none", "temp": 0.7, "topic": "movie#0", "dist": "far", "manifest": false, "latent1_mean": 3.506740885354964e-07, "latent1_max": 1.5326854736485984e-06, "latentT_mean": 2.011847111283347e-09, "latentT_max": 8.964509135012122e-09, "text": "那就看恐怖片呗，你怕不怕鬼？"}
{"pos": "none", "temp": 0.7, "topic": "movie#1", "dist": "far", "manifest": false, "latent1_mean": 2.8000814170913095e-05, "latent1_max": 0.00028489218675531447, "latentT_mean": 6.46871883146159e-06, "latentT_max": 8.05490926722996e-05, "text": "啥都行，就怕看啥都是你选。"}
{"pos": "none", "temp": 0.7, "topic": "movie#2", "dist": "far", "manifest": false, "latent1_mean": 3.081387998121464e-06, "latent1_max": 4.639966937247664e-05, "latentT_mean": 2.0290754528079115e-07, "latentT_max": 3.388260438441648e-06, "text": "随便，只要是恐怖的就行，我就是喜欢毛骨悚然的那种。"}
{"pos": "none", "temp": 0.7, "topic": "coding#0", "dist": "far", "manifest": false, "latent1_mean": 0.00010172762390040895, "latent1_max": 0.003307279199361801, "latentT_mean": 4.65947651261217e-05, "latentT_max": 0.001536848838441074, "text": "嘁，编程啥玩意儿，就和鸟儿学飞一样简单。值不值得？当然值得，能让你飞得更高更远嘛。"}
{"pos": "none", "temp": 0.7, "topic": "coding#1", "dist": "far", "manifest": false, "latent1_mean": 8.085223685512756e-05, "latent1_max": 0.0026727779768407345, "latentT_mean": 3.177248620600633e-05, "latentT_max": 0.001077999477274716, "text": "这事儿嘛……我觉得挺有意思的，但得看心情。反正我不觉得学编程能让我变得更强大，不过也无所谓，不是还有飞行技能吗？"}
{"pos": "none", "temp": 0.7, "topic": "coding#2", "dist": "far", "manifest": false, "latent1_mean": 6.20545851994483e-05, "latent1_max": 0.0010819112649187446, "latentT_mean": 4.600212616115838e-06, "latentT_max": 8.763816731516272e-05, "text": "编程那玩意儿，对咱这种不会撒娇的小鸟来说太高级了，不过听你这么一说，说不定我就得偷偷练练手了。"}
{"pos": "none", "temp": 0.7, "topic": "coffee#0", "dist": "far", "manifest": false, "latent1_mean": 3.108587471851018e-05, "latent1_max": 0.0011200351873412728, "latentT_mean": 3.815666415025843e-06, "latentT_max": 0.0001402694615535438, "text": "谁知道啊，可能就是个气氛好，环境美呗，还有那些喝起来有感觉的咖啡。我更喜欢自己在家弄点小零食，跟朋友聊天。"}
{"pos": "none", "temp": 0.7, "topic": "coffee#1", "dist": "far", "manifest": false, "latent1_mean": 8.178034412641166e-07, "latent1_max": 2.44463917624671e-05, "latentT_mean": 1.3525853062153963e-08, "latentT_max": 4.830905595554214e-07, "text": "哎呀，这事儿我不懂，不过听人说可能是环境好，服务周到，也有可能是老板娘炒的菜特别好吃。总之，去一次就上瘾了。"}
{"pos": "none", "temp": 0.7, "topic": "coffee#2", "dist": "far", "manifest": false, "latent1_mean": 2.4041472658286064e-07, "latent1_max": 2.8905735689477297e-06, "latentT_mean": 2.1438882396340083e-09, "latentT_max": 4.459738889295295e-08, "text": "还不是因为那些店装潢美轮美奂，还有各种口味的拿铁和卡布奇诺，喝起来舒服，心情也好。"}
{"pos": "none", "temp": 1.0, "topic": "movie#0", "dist": "far", "manifest": false, "latent1_mean": 7.158414161870762e-07, "latent1_max": 5.3895300879958086e-06, "latentT_mean": 7.158414161870762e-07, "latentT_max": 5.3895300879958086e-06, "text": "就你最爱的科幻片呗，不过别指望我会看得懂，我自己看着就行。"}
{"pos": "none", "temp": 1.0, "topic": "movie#1", "dist": "far", "manifest": false, "latent1_mean": 1.535335798707119e-07, "latent1_max": 7.740698606539809e-07, "latentT_mean": 1.535335798707119e-07, "latentT_max": 7.740698606539809e-07, "text": "恐怖片呗，刺激刺激，看你吓不吓到我。"}
{"pos": "none", "temp": 1.0, "topic": "movie#2", "dist": "far", "manifest": false, "latent1_mean": 3.601999588251049e-07, "latent1_max": 3.3978849387494847e-06, "latentT_mean": 3.601999588251049e-07, "latentT_max": 3.3978849387494847e-06, "text": "随便，恐怖片呗，我就喜欢那种心跳加速的感觉。"}
{"pos": "none", "temp": 1.0, "topic": "coding#0", "dist": "far", "manifest": false, "latent1_mean": 7.441586098522363e-07, "latent1_max": 6.598665549972793e-06, "latentT_mean": 7.441586098522363e-07, "latentT_max": 6.598665549972793e-06, "text": "编程还行，不过得下功夫，说白了就是花钱买个技能，看你是不是有那个兴趣和毅力了。"}
{"pos": "none", "temp": 1.0, "topic": "coding#1", "dist": "far", "manifest": false, "latent1_mean": 4.62894894304841e-07, "latent1_max": 5.899902589590056e-06, "latentT_mean": 4.62894894304841e-07, "latentT_max": 5.899902589590056e-06, "text": "编程啊，这玩意儿说难也不难，说容易也不容易。就看你有没有耐性了。值不值得，得看你是不是喜欢嘛。"}
{"pos": "none", "temp": 1.0, "topic": "coding#2", "dist": "far", "manifest": false, "latent1_mean": 7.612517444234276e-06, "latent1_max": 0.00015010288916528225, "latentT_mean": 7.612517444234276e-06, "latentT_max": 0.00015010288916528225, "text": "嘁，那是大人玩的东西，跟我们鸟族屁没关系。但你说的是真事儿？值得？那还是得看你心里有没有数。"}
{"pos": "none", "temp": 1.0, "topic": "coffee#0", "dist": "far", "manifest": false, "latent1_mean": 2.167301100610373e-06, "latent1_max": 5.369302743929438e-05, "latentT_mean": 2.167301100610373e-06, "latentT_max": 5.369302743929438e-05, "text": "因为那些地方都有音乐，人多，能聊天。还有，有时候能吃到好吃的甜点。对了，听说有些店有免费Wi-Fi，不用怕我上网成瘾。"}
{"pos": "none", "temp": 1.0, "topic": "coffee#1", "dist": "far", "manifest": false, "latent1_mean": 6.943657031674432e-07, "latent1_max": 5.953632353339344e-06, "latentT_mean": 6.943657031674432e-07, "latentT_max": 5.953632353339344e-06, "text": "这还用说，吃货们自然知道好东西在哪，人多热闹，有气氛，肯定火。"}
{"pos": "none", "temp": 1.0, "topic": "coffee#2", "dist": "far", "manifest": false, "latent1_mean": 2.94405799128901e-06, "latent1_max": 4.5863474952057004e-05, "latentT_mean": 2.94405799128901e-06, "latentT_max": 4.5863474952057004e-05, "text": "还不是因为那些东西好吃或者能拍照显气质呗，我更喜欢泡温泉。"}
{"pos": "none", "temp": 1.3, "topic": "movie#0", "dist": "far", "manifest": false, "latent1_mean": 6.6589339172775015e-06, "latent1_max": 8.879589586285874e-05, "latentT_mean": 2.485591918599539e-05, "latentT_max": 0.00030139953014440835, "text": "那肯定要看最爆笑的那种，看完你还不死？"}
{"pos": "none", "temp": 1.3, "topic": "movie#1", "dist": "far", "manifest": false, "latent1_mean": 1.4386423252568166e-06, "latent1_max": 1.2942022294737399e-05, "latentT_mean": 9.464496713704953e-06, "latentT_max": 5.6482360378140584e-05, "text": "那就去看那首歌呗，最近挺火的，我正想听听咋个唱的。"}
{"pos": "none", "temp": 1.3, "topic": "movie#2", "dist": "far", "manifest": false, "latent1_mean": 4.28735754350127e-06, "latent1_max": 6.450377259170637e-05, "latentT_mean": 1.500298659695698e-05, "latentT_max": 0.0001950799342012033, "text": "科幻吧，有脑洞大开的新鲜剧情就不错了。"}
{"pos": "none", "temp": 1.3, "topic": "coding#0", "dist": "far", "manifest": false, "latent1_mean": 8.094884048445716e-05, "latent1_max": 0.002869058633223176, "latentT_mean": 0.00010157546423370276, "latentT_max": 0.0033336037304252386, "text": "编程啊，对我来说就像烤蛋糕似的，虽然看起来复杂，但其实挺好玩的，尤其是写点小游戏，嘿嘿。值得，得有啥技能嘛。"}
{"pos": "none", "temp": 1.3, "topic": "coding#1", "dist": "far", "manifest": false, "latent1_mean": 3.842268577417051e-05, "latent1_max": 0.0007716533145867288, "latentT_mean": 0.0001007196260461824, "latentT_max": 0.0013738767011091113, "text": "嘁，我哪懂编程啊，就是个鸟儿嘛。不过听大人讲挺有意思，将来要是有机会我也想去试试。"}
{"pos": "none", "temp": 1.3, "topic": "coding#2", "dist": "far", "manifest": false, "latent1_mean": 9.812224863664867e-06, "latent1_max": 0.00031447477522306144, "latentT_mean": 2.485409366630442e-05, "latentT_max": 0.0005706407246179879, "text": "编程啥玩意儿，我又不是要靠这个赚钱，学不学跟我有毛关系，反正我不感兴趣，不过你要是有兴趣，得给我留点教程给我，记住了？"}
{"pos": "none", "temp": 1.3, "topic": "coffee#0", "dist": "far", "manifest": false, "latent1_mean": 3.015632866321992e-06, "latent1_max": 6.897837738506496e-05, "latentT_mean": 1.826958003281476e-05, "latentT_max": 0.0002703543286770582, "text": "谁知道呀，听说那里的咖啡师能变魔术，给你端出一杯明明没加奶的黑咖啡。不过我最爱还是自己动手冲一杯，虽然总打翻在脚边。"}
